0..67 Comment "//! `circuit-rule-block` models a circuit rule in a `theory` block."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..145 Comment "//! `cong1` routes a rewrite result and one data input through two nodes."
146..221 Comment "//! The pathological circuit sources refuse cycles and invalid rule wiring."
